**First line of STATUS (placeholder at Step 0 `GATE VERDICT B1052: PENDING`; verdict form, ONE line):** `GATE VERDICT B1052: branch b1049/hpsmpoc-428-wake-open-retry <GO|GO WITH FINDINGS|NO GO> @ 35b343a on main <sha7> (round 1 of 2 on class "API retry of a connection open that timed out during a database wake"; NO GO 0 before; NO PR, hosted CI, SQL Server leg and CodeQL NOT RUN - delta <1 commit, 3 paths 2/1 71/0 334/0 y, registration-only edit y, ASCII y, protected files equal n of n y> - EF <source and loaded list agree y; -2 and pool wait not retried by EF y; count/cap 6/30 s at main and head y; -2 throttle +5 s y> - open-only <T4 y; command/transaction scratch rows n of n not retried y; close path S1 head <retried|not>, main not, SqlClient reachability <proven unreachable|reachable|unproven>> - scopes <ExpectAnyFailure 2 flows not retried y; keyed nesting reachable n> - transactions <T9a T9b y; guard unchanged y; delegate census n sites, repeat risk n> - mark <S4 concurrent n of n y; same-instance y; mis-mark reachable n; leak 0 y> - budget <give-up 56.0/86.0 s; abandoned 266/296 s; dead-DB error ~90 s; cancellation reaches EF wait y/n> - red-first <T1 T2 T9a red, 8 green y> - suite <SQLite Api.Tests head p/f/s vs base p/f/s, names lost 0; build 0 warnings> - mutation <P1-P5 P4b as expected n of 6; g red n of 13; g15 green y> - SQL Server census <(c) n, (d) n; predicted wall s> - messages true n of N - overlap <open PRs 0; live hits 0> - gitleaks rc <n> - landing files 4 checked y)`. Then the sections: Step 0 (sha256s, slot count), REFUSE counts, PINS (start, mid, verdict), instrument and load, PRIOR WORK, predictions with evidence paths, C1-C12 each with the FAIL clock and evidence path, the EF table (number or form, source answer, loaded answer), the wait table, the open-only table (phase x form x head x main), the scope census table, the delegate census table, the concurrency table, the budget lines, the red-first table, the suite table, the mutation table (